## Bundled distributions in this extension

- Embedra extension code, documentation, pack manifests, catalog snapshots,
  and fixture-derived reference data: Apache-2.0.
- Ghidra-derived Xtensa language definition sources
  (`data/languages/xtensa.cspec`, `xtensa.pspec`, `xtensaArch.sinc`,
  `xtensaInstructions.sinc`, `xtensaMain.sinc`, `cust.sinc`, `flix.sinc`):
  byte-identical copies of files from the pinned Ghidra 12.1.3 PUBLIC
  distribution, which is Apache-2.0 licensed. Ghidra's own copyright and
  license notice apply to those files. The Embedra SALT/SALTU additions
  (`embedra_esp32s3.*`) are original work under Apache-2.0.
- Espressif-derived packs and snapshots (ROM symbol tables, peripheral
  register windows, SVD descriptions, product facts, Function ID pilot):
  deterministic, non-expressive derivations of Apache-2.0 ESP-IDF and
  Apache-2.0 Espressif SVD sources at pinned revisions, with the source
  identity, license, revision, transformation, and content digest recorded in
  every pack manifest and catalog snapshot. No Espressif page images, prose,
  or descriptive content is redistributed.
- Raspberry Pi-derived catalog facts: non-expressive factual derivations
  (identifiers, memory sizes, pin counts, board settings) documented against
  the official Raspberry Pi datasheets. The datasheets themselves are
  licensed under the Raspberry Pi documentation terms and are not
  redistributed.
- STMicroelectronics-derived data: normalized facts derived from the
  BSD-3-Clause `STM32_open_pin_data` repository, from ST CMSIS device
  repositories (Apache-2.0), from pinned BSD-3-Clause ST board/BSP
  repositories, and from the ST `stm32c5xx-dfp` repository (BSD-3-Clause with
  Apache-2.0 SVD files). The conditions and disclaimer of the BSD-3-Clause
  sources are preserved in `licenses/STMicroelectronics-STM32-open-pin-data-BSD-3-Clause.txt`.
  ST archives carrying SLA0044 or SLA0048 terms were inspected only as
  review oracles and are never bundled or redistributed.
- STM32F1 library signatures: derived function names and masked byte
  patterns from an audited build of statically and permissively licensed
  STM32Cube F1 components only (BSD-3-Clause, Apache-2.0, MIT); no vendor
  source, header, object, or toolchain runtime is bundled.

